[section:ReadMultiHandler Multiple-datagram read handler requirements]

A multiple-datagram read handler must meet the requirements for a [link
asio.reference.Handler handler]. A value `h` of a multiple-datagram read
handler class should work correctly in the expression `h(ec, n)`, where `ec`
is an lvalue of type `const error_code` and `n` is an lvalue of type
`const size_t` that holds the number of datagrams received.

[endsect]
